{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19mini_level_act19mini_st02","groupId":"act19mini","stageId":null,"title":"蒲先生","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19mini/level_act19mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"f3678ccb34e1af1a386148b5aca8f60c5957d7b6c57e2731773ca83335686b2e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"麟青硯在置錐學塾見到了會說話的掃把、會走路的畫卷……並從蒲先生口中得知了小鎮的真相，也意識到為了爭奪秘笈，更大的麻煩正在小鎮上醞釀。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini03_privateschool"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，先生！不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君……胡君他——他死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是何時的事……怎會如此……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在胡君平日待著的那個茶館，他從二樓跌了下來，摔死啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定……一定是被那個壞女人殺死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一定，還會回來找我們的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……我平常是怎麼教你們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於未見之事不可輕言，你們既然沒有親眼看到，怎麼能妄下定論？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是先生還說過，要舉一反三。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個壞女人最近殺了好多人，這次胡君怎麼可能不是她殺的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉一反三，說的是理，不是事，更不是人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己不想被別人惡意相向，便應該想到別人也不願意被惡意相向，這叫做理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但一個人做了一件錯事，便說他此生只能做錯事，那就叫不講理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了罷了，其中的道理不是三兩句話就能說通的，眼下還有更要緊的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君在茶館墜樓身亡，那有沒有人撿到他的遺骸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我是真的親眼看見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君從樓上掉下來後，有一個天師打扮的人，把摔碎的胡君撿走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還有天師……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就不是什麼玩笑了，你確定看清楚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得清清楚楚，胡君摔死的時候，那個天師就在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我還看到，那個人拿著胡君的屍體，在鎮上到處打聽呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了……既然此事已經被撞見，恐怕免不了一番糾纏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，胡君的遺骸還在那位天師手上，得想個辦法……得想個辦法拿回來才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生的意思，是想讓我們從那天師手上把胡君的屍體偷出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說了多少遍，歿去的同胞，要稱“遺骸”，不可稱屍體……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，是“竊”，不是“偷”。我不是和你們講過，為了一己私慾稱之為“偷”，為了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"私塾先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說了不說了，時間緊張，那位天師隨時會到。按我之前教過你們的，都各自去準備吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請問……閣下是“蒲先生”嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini03_privateschool"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯自從走進了這間不大的學堂，便一言不發，仔細審視著屋裡的每一個物品。\n過了足足有一炷香的工夫，坐在她對面的老先生終於忍不住開了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我介紹一下，在下麟青硯，是大理……是天師府的一名天師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從大人的打扮上是看得出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒲先生平時也會與天師打交道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座小鎮臨近天師府，平日裡鎮上百姓的生活多仰仗天師們關照。當然是認得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位麟天師……今天究竟是為何事到訪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怕先生笑話，今天我初到這座邙山鎮，就遇到了一件怪事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小鎮南邊的茶館，有一位自稱胡君的跑堂。未時三刻，在茶館裡下毒綁架了四名遊客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我剛好撞見此事，正要追捕的時候，卻親眼看見他從二樓摔了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我趕到墜落場地的時候，在那裡只看見了一個摔碎的茶壺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為是自己眼花。然而事實證明，當時在場的所有人中，不只是我看到了這一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說，有一個人從樓上墜亡，卻變成了碎茶壺？這簡直是聞所未聞的奇事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……麟天師，您說的這個碎茶壺，能不能讓我瞧一眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯的手伸入口袋中，拿出了一個包裹放在桌上。\n蒲先生正要拿過，麟青硯卻一把按住了包裹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生請稍等，我想先問先生幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……天師儘管問就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我在鎮上打聽死者消息，許多人都說知道有胡君此人，而且其中不少都說這位胡君是蒲先生您的熟人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我奇怪的是，我常年住在百灶，卻從來沒有聽說過與百灶近在咫尺的邙山下還有這樣一座小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座邙山鎮上沒有官府管事，大家有什麼事都找您的這座“置錐學塾”來解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，先生在這座小鎮名望頗高？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡的話……哪裡的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師的問題，我都能回答……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實這座小鎮，早年間也算熱鬧，可是後來慢慢地，百灶城建得越來越大，年輕人都跑去城裡找生計了，鎮上的人也就越來越少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在雖然還叫一個鎮，但實際上才不過五百多戶人家。再加上臨近天師府，出不了什麼亂子，朝廷也就放心不管啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於老朽，之前不過是個讀過幾本書的窮書生，學問還無法通過考校，只能在這裡教教孩子讀書認字，混口飯吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多年都是這樣過來的，鄉親們稱我一聲先生，遇上點麻煩事願意問問我的意見，已經是折煞人啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生怕是謙虛了，教書育人本來就是有德之舉，您自然擔得起這些敬重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我注意到，您這間屋子裡的收藏，書籍字畫、古董文玩，怎麼看都不像是凡物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，麟天師應該是看錯了。這些都是平日裡我認識的天師所贈，天南地北蒐集來的雜物，只是有些年頭，不算什麼值錢物品的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於天師問起的那位胡君……咳咳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知什麼緣故，桌上的燭台突然翻倒，滾燙的蠟油差點濺到麟青硯的手上。\n麟青硯連忙起身，身後的椅子又突然翻倒，險些讓她摔了一跤。\n就在這一會的工夫，蒲先生眼疾手快，將桌上的包裹調了包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師……您、您沒事吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這屋裡的物品都太老舊，多多少少都有些問題，得罪了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛才說到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，剛才說到，那位胡君，的確是我的一位朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是鎮上那座老茶館的夥計，會點泡茶的功夫，平時算我一個茶酒朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否知道他平日裡有什麼仇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我就不知道了……在我看來，那胡君的確是個本分人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是人和人打交道，哪有可能一點磨擦都沒有？或許是他無意間對誰說過幾句得罪誰，又或者欠了誰的錢拖了幾日……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生在世，誰能沒幾個“仇家”呢？這就真的不好說啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生願意告訴我的，只有這些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是願不願意……在下知道的，也就只有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生為人師表，在下不願意迫使先生做失德之舉。先生說話前請三思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等先生願意和在下交談的時候，我們還會見面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚已多有打擾，在下告辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini03_privateschool"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，先生，那個天師走了嗎？她放過我們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您拿到胡君的遺骸了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒲先生這才緩緩從桌子下面拿出了那個包裹，小心翼翼地打開。\n其中包著的卻並不是什麼茶壺的碎片，而是一堆碎石頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位麟天師，是個聰明人，也是個厚道的人啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了……還是得再去跑一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們好好看家，我去去就回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的學生","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生、先生——您不要我們幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也行，跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini02_marketn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"已是夜深人靜，麟青硯走在無人的街上。此時街上若是有人的話，便能看到一幅詭異的奇景。\n在天師身後十步遠的牆邊靠著一根笤帚。不知為何，無論她怎麼走，那把笤帚始終與她保持著這個距離。\n且不論街上怎麼會有一根家用的笤帚，畢竟，屋簷上還有一隻繡花鞋，啪嗒啪嗒地跟著那把笤帚，又有一幅貼在牆上的字，跟著那隻鞋。\n而後是彈跳的扁擔、滾動的藥瓶、咚咚作響的撥浪鼓……跟在這條浩浩蕩蕩的長隊最後的，正是蒲先生。\n隊伍在一家客棧門口停了下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"笤帚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蒲先生，那個天師不見了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她進了這家客棧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扁擔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這點可以確定，但是進了客棧裡，就看不到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到那位天師了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到那個壞女人，追過來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_yanshabbyroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲……我的腰……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我不願相信是你……可是除了你，還能是誰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必多言，我只想知道，先生為何要騙我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騙你？我何時騙過你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你口口聲聲說，那本秘笈是假的，要我們不必理會。但那個茶壺為什麼會在今天參與茶館的交易，又為何會拿到這本秘笈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誤會……都是誤會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管什麼誤會，我現在找你只有一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本秘笈中“化人”的法門，請先生為我解惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真……就這麼想離開這座小鎮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與故人之約，先生又豈不知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年來，我多次苦苦求先生告訴我離開小鎮的方法，您卻總勸我不要操之過急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，現在這本秘笈就在眼前，先生還有什麼藉口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生桃李滿門，您就再教我這一件事又能如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾日來，為了爭奪這本秘笈，你不惜出手傷人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要變成人，不知先學人的良善、仁愛，卻先學會人的怨恨、暴戾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是讓你這樣離開小鎮，那只能是害了你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仁愛……哼，我心中的愛，你們又怎麼會懂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，你還要藏私嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜……但你所謂“化人”的法門，我也一竅不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你恨我也好，要殺我也罷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我昧著良心，矇騙學生，那是萬萬不能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……蒲先生，我向來是敬重你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，不要怨我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的劍客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍客的劍還未落下，屋外飛來一劍，挾著雷霆之威，擊退了劍客。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍客敏銳意識到敵人的實力不凡，毫不停留，翻窗逃走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她跑了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師……剛才都聽到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽了個大概，也猜了個大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意相信先生有苦衷，但先生先前的舉動，確實不太妥當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師責備得是……唉，這下弄的，斯文掃地，斯文掃地啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是麟天師，你是怎麼知道我被人挾持……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一根會說話的掃把跟了我一路，還請我來救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我今天再見到什麼事，都不會覺得奇怪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini03_privateschool"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師請坐，先喝杯茶吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒲先生話音剛落，一個盤子托著茶壺與茶杯，送上了茶。\n麟青硯見狀，也只是皺了下眉頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些器物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都是這間學塾裡的學生，也都是“倀”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪今天見到的那些鎮民，都是那樣怪異……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這座小鎮裡的人難道全都是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的是人，有的是倀。至於各自為數幾何，這麼多年過去，我也搞不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年前，這座小鎮就變成了這個樣子，之前告訴麟天師的那些話，也不算假話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受巨獸影響誕生的倀物，我之前有所耳聞。但從來沒有見過心智與人類如此接近的“倀”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師難道忘了，這附近有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……歲陵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道巨獸化身有附身器物之能，而“歲”實在是過於強大，被鎮壓了千年，僅僅是逸散出來的力量就足以讓一些器物化為“倀”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情，絕不是一般人所能知道的。先生難道是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在司歲台當“巨獸學士”，也是幾十年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生也有涯，知也無涯……研究巨獸的學問做不到頭，也研究得自己沒了人味，我便交了封辭呈，想躲進山裡隱居，這才發現了這座小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾十年前，這座小鎮還常有倀物作亂，天師府不時得派天師鎮壓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想著，那些“倀”誕生於人世間，無依無憑也是可憐。何況他們之中有的沾染了不少人性，神智也與人有幾分相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其看他們四處作亂繼而被消滅，不如試著教教他們人的仁義禮法，說不定他們還能與人和諧共處呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢的，就有了這座“置錐學塾”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生高義……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢不敢……我講這些話並不是想向天師邀功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想來也好笑，我前半生幫人們研究“獸”，後半生幫“倀”們學做人。可到頭來才發現自己於兩頭竟然都是一知半解，不求甚解……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也是在躲起來之後，我才覺得這些器物，實在是可愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為日子能這樣一直過到頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實幾日前，我收到了一封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“機密要聞，勿轉他人手”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini03_privateschool"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人自稱拿到了一本絕世秘笈，是那位玉門宗師親筆所著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳聞中，那位宗師身為巨獸化身，卻能為自己塑造出一副人的身體，那書中記載的功法，也能讓倀物“變為人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事竟然還牽扯到玉門，難道左樂說的變故就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，讓“倀”變成人，那本秘笈當真能做到此事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，這件事我也不知真假。但重要的是，有不少倀都信其為真。繼而引發了不少亂事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說，寫信人的目的，就是為了引得這座小鎮人心惶惶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……不好說，不好說喲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的消息，都已經告訴您了，麟天師現在有何打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歲獸之事，本不在我職責範圍內。但倀物傷人，身為天師府天師，絕不可坐視不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那幕後主使包藏禍心，那我更不能姑息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好……看得出麟天師是位正直之人。這件事交由您去追查，我也可以放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟天師……最後還有一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那胡君的“遺體”，能否交給在下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生是準備安葬他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是安葬，也不只是安葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這間書房……名為旦暮堂。這裡擺放的每一個破損的器物，曾經都是“倀”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倀的生死，與人不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們生於人寄託於物的執念；亡於器物損毀，或是執念消弭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些損毀的器物若是能修復好，或許有朝一日，還能有神識顯現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個茶壺——不，這位胡君……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡君的主人，原來是這座鎮上的一個茶農。他好茶，也懂茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經，他在山上精心開墾了幾畝茶田，年年清明前採茶煎茶的時候，在這鎮上隨便哪裡舀一瓢井水，喝到嘴裡都是茶香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他還不知足，一心要找天下最好的茶種、最清冽的泉水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一年，他聽聞炎國極南的海邊有株天岳春的母樹。他二話不說，僱了船隊就往南邊去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這一去，就再也沒有回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那茶農的一點痴心，就依憑於這個與他日日相伴的茶壺上。也不怪這位胡君，總想著要逃出小鎮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_1043_leizi2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位茶農，是先生的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯從包裹中掏出一個匣子，匣子中放的，是小心收納起來的茶壺碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒲先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝天師……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"63_mini01_market"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禮貌的先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雲先生，在下恭候多時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在抱歉，遇上了一些意外，讓您久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禮貌的先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雲先生說，想要先在這座鎮上遊覽一番，如今是否盡興了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這鎮上人物風情，都令在下大開眼界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雲青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓那位先生等的時間太長也不好，我們這就動身吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禮貌的先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_1638_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，請跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
